They're in the conference room.

1285
00:54:46.840 --> 00:54:54.280
Jim says, okay, so far, our ideal party consists of beer, fights to the death, cupcakes, blood

1286
00:54:54.280 --> 00:54:59.720
pudding, blood, touch football, mating, charades, and yes, horse hunting.

1287
00:55:00.340 --> 00:55:00.840
Yeah.

1288
00:55:01.280 --> 00:55:02.060
And Dwight's like, you're right.

1289
00:55:02.180 --> 00:55:02.920
Forget horse hunting.

1290
00:55:03.080 --> 00:55:03.480
It's stupid.

1291
00:55:04.600 --> 00:55:06.400
Just only lose that one.

1292
00:55:06.580 --> 00:55:07.940
All the rest are viable.

1293
00:55:08.260 --> 00:55:08.420
Yeah.

1294
00:55:15.300 --> 00:55:17.120
Everyone gathers in the conference room.

1295
00:55:17.340 --> 00:55:18.180
Kelly comes in.

1296
00:55:18.460 --> 00:55:19.180
There's a cake.

1297
00:55:19.420 --> 00:55:20.500
Her name is spelled wrong.

1298
00:55:20.620 --> 00:55:20.980
Mm-hmm.

1299
00:55:21.140 --> 00:55:22.060
And there's a chiclet.

1300
00:55:22.640 --> 00:55:23.940
You know what a chiclet is?

1301
00:55:24.080 --> 00:55:24.560
I do.

1302
00:55:24.680 --> 00:55:26.340
It's a piece of gum and it's a square.

1303
00:55:26.480 --> 00:55:27.960
It's a little square piece of gum.

1304
00:55:28.160 --> 00:55:29.340
I love a chiclet.

1305
00:55:29.340 --> 00:55:30.240
I love a chiclet, too.

1306
00:55:30.240 --> 00:55:33.260
I like it that it has like a candy coating before I chew the gum.

1307
00:55:33.360 --> 00:55:34.300
I like the crunch.

1308
00:55:34.540 --> 00:55:34.900
Me, too.

1309
00:55:35.580 --> 00:55:37.740
Kelly wants to know what's up with the chiclet.

1310
00:55:38.120 --> 00:55:40.120
Jim says, that's the best part.

1311
00:55:40.480 --> 00:55:42.560
The chiclet represents a pillow.

1312
00:55:42.820 --> 00:55:44.680
It's a pillow or a television.

1313
00:55:45.220 --> 00:55:46.140
That's our theme.

1314
00:55:46.400 --> 00:55:49.200
A pillow or a television is their theme.

1315
00:55:49.440 --> 00:55:52.540
She gets to decide one hour of TV or an hour of napping.

1316
00:55:52.780 --> 00:55:53.800
What would you pick?

1317
00:55:54.060 --> 00:55:57.260
I would, oh, I don't know if I could sleep at work.

1318
00:55:57.500 --> 00:55:59.640
I can't nap in general.

1319
00:55:59.640 --> 00:56:02.720
I have to be sick in order to take a nap.

1320
00:56:02.860 --> 00:56:07.820
Even if I've gotten three hours of sleep the night before, I can't nap.

1321
00:56:08.040 --> 00:56:10.180
I get like wired tired.

1322
00:56:10.720 --> 00:56:14.160
So I would 100% pick an hour of TV.

1323
00:56:14.160 --> 00:56:18.280
There is so much TV I haven't been able to watch lately because we've been working really

1324
00:56:18.280 --> 00:56:19.120
hard on the book.

1325
00:56:19.260 --> 00:56:24.080
So I mean, I'm in the middle of the White Lotus.

1326
00:56:24.140 --> 00:56:26.000
I'm in the middle of Hacks.

1327
00:56:26.320 --> 00:56:28.980
I only just finished Mare of Easttown.

1328
00:56:29.120 --> 00:56:30.620
Do you hear how behind I am?

1329
00:56:30.800 --> 00:56:31.060
Yeah.

1330
00:56:31.060 --> 00:56:34.480
So hour of TV, yes, please.

1331
00:56:34.740 --> 00:56:35.940
That sounds decadent to me.

1332
00:56:36.460 --> 00:56:38.640
Also, yeah, I can't sleep during the day.

1333
00:56:38.800 --> 00:56:41.360
Something has to be wrong with me if I fall asleep during the day.

1334
00:56:41.460 --> 00:56:41.640
Yeah.

1335
00:56:41.740 --> 00:56:43.100
It's just like my body just won't do it.

1336
00:56:43.640 --> 00:56:47.200
I do think this is a little bit of an old tech alert.

1337
00:56:47.500 --> 00:56:48.560
What's the old tech?

1338
00:56:48.560 --> 00:56:53.440
They say that the chiclet represents a pillow or a television.

1339
00:56:54.620 --> 00:56:59.160
And I think at work now, we would just watch an hour on our phone or our computer.

1340
00:56:59.400 --> 00:57:00.020
That's true.

1341
00:57:00.240 --> 00:57:03.660
And also, doesn't Stanley say there's nothing good on right now?

1342
00:57:04.000 --> 00:57:06.620
Well, Creed says Bonnie Hunt's on.

1343
00:57:06.800 --> 00:57:09.680
But it's that they're going to watch like live television.

1344
00:57:09.820 --> 00:57:10.340
That's right.

1345
00:57:10.500 --> 00:57:11.780
Not streaming anything.

1346
00:57:12.160 --> 00:57:12.660
No streaming.

1347
00:57:13.620 --> 00:57:17.100
So I would say their theme was a little bit of an old tech alert.

1348
00:57:17.380 --> 00:57:17.880
I agree.

1349
00:57:18.300 --> 00:57:20.240
Well, Kelly chooses nap.

1350
00:57:20.360 --> 00:57:23.160
And she takes a little nap under the conference table.

1351
00:57:23.400 --> 00:57:29.120
And while she does, Jim and Dwight sit on that little couch by reception.

1352
00:57:29.120 --> 00:57:30.360
And they eat their cake.

1353
00:57:30.400 --> 00:57:31.860
And they're very proud of themselves.

1354
00:57:32.160 --> 00:57:34.620
And I want to point out this scene to everyone.

1355
00:57:34.620 --> 00:57:42.780
Because John is doing a classic, fakey, eaty acting technique with this cake.

1356
00:57:43.020 --> 00:57:44.740
He's shoving the food around the plate.

1357
00:57:45.020 --> 00:57:47.860
He would take a big scoop of cake.

1358
00:57:48.080 --> 00:57:51.560
But then he smushes it back down.

1359
00:57:51.760 --> 00:57:56.100
And so by the time he puts it in his mouth, it just has a little frosting on it.

1360
00:57:56.620 --> 00:57:57.360
Watch it.

1361
00:57:57.520 --> 00:58:01.800
He goes for the cake three times and never actually eats a piece.

1362
00:58:02.040 --> 00:58:04.460
At the beginning, he eats like half a piece.

1363
00:58:05.060 --> 00:58:06.340
You have to do this.

1364
00:58:06.600 --> 00:58:08.420
Because otherwise, you're going to get sick.

1365
00:58:09.180 --> 00:58:13.960
However, sitting next to him is Rainn Wilson, who eats the cake.

1366
00:58:14.600 --> 00:58:14.860
Rainn?

1367
00:58:14.860 --> 00:58:16.580
Because Rainn always ate in scenes.

1368
00:58:16.800 --> 00:58:17.480
It didn't matter.

1369
00:58:17.720 --> 00:58:19.840
Remember, he ate so many bananas, he got sick.

1370
00:58:20.020 --> 00:58:20.240
Yeah.

1371
00:58:20.520 --> 00:58:23.480
When Rainn, as Dwight, does anything, he goes all out.

1372
00:58:23.660 --> 00:58:23.820
Yep.

1373
00:58:24.160 --> 00:58:28.480
And I feel like Rainn eats in scenes the way Brad Pitt eats in movies.

1374
00:58:28.920 --> 00:58:30.360
Watch in Ocean's 12.

1375
00:58:30.620 --> 00:58:31.820
The guy is always eating.

1376
00:58:32.060 --> 00:58:33.760
I wanted to know, like, is this a choice?

1377
00:58:33.760 --> 00:58:35.480
You're constantly eating something.

1378
00:58:35.700 --> 00:58:36.800
Watch Goodfellas.

1379
00:58:36.900 --> 00:58:39.360
Do you see how much steak and pasta those guys eat?

1380
00:58:39.520 --> 00:58:40.600
They dig in.

1381
00:58:40.800 --> 00:58:42.000
Goodfellas makes me hungry.

1382
00:58:42.240 --> 00:58:42.600
Yeah.

1383
00:58:42.740 --> 00:58:43.960
When I watch it, I get hungry.

1384
00:58:44.120 --> 00:58:44.560
For sure.

1385
